+- Tree: `9abc1413bf4f44ab048985cbbcebe1e4fc099d8f`
+- Import date: `2026-07-21`
+- License: MIT; the unmodified upstream license text is preserved in `LICENSE` and
+  `../../LICENSES/lark-codex-bridge-MIT.txt`.
+
+The vendoring script verifies the tag object, peeled commit, source tree, and
+license before applying the audited patches listed in `PATCHES.md`.
